      "props": {
        "text": "Hanno Böck reports Ubuntu had no fix for \"NoisyTCP\" as of Nov 25 while other distros did, plus an unpatched AMD KVM host escape (CVE-2026-99312). These are his claims; no Ubuntu response was included.",
        "variant": "body"
      },
      "children": []
    },
    "i2_why": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "Why it matters: Ubuntu hosts exposed to the network may need mitigations or a different kernel until fixes ship.",
